            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a rotary blade assembly (100) for a food processing appliance, comprising: a hub (140) configured to rotate in use about axis of rotation, and a plurality of blades (110, 120, 130) extending away from said hub, wherein at least two angles about the axis of rotation separating the blades differ.</p>
